            "B": "₹10",
            "C": "₹20",
            "D": "₹25"
          },
          "explanation": "2 वर्ष के लिए, CI − SI = P(R/100)² = 2000 × (5/100)² = 2000 × 1/400 = ₹5।"
        }
      }
